  {
    "id": "anno-shizuoka_lower_p237_left-04",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "大小參事　七人（一二八人）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "大小参事　七人（一二八人）／だいしょうさんじ しちにん"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Senior and junior councillors taken together (dai-shō-sanji): 7 persons. The printed figure does not reconcile with the leaf. Eight men are named in the four office columns to the left: two senior councillors (屋山外記, 庵原覺平), two acting senior councillors (佐野三郎治, 森脩), two junior councillors (立花碩, 吉村土肥) and two acting junior councillors (中島裕, 堀七右衞門). A small-type parenthetical （一二八人）is set in the gutter immediately to the right of the figure and is recorded here verbatim. Its second glyph is graphically identical to the katakana ニ, so the gloss may be the reprint editor's correction 「一ニ八人」 (one text has eight persons), which would match the eight names exactly; read as digits it is 128 persons for something this leaf does not name. The leaf alone does not settle which."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "三池大小參事七人"
      }
    ],
